```

# Data Flow

Developer → Agent (scan skill) → MCP Server → SQLite DB → normalized archnaut.json → Chokidar → WebSocket → Web UI

# Daemon Lifecycle

```
archnaut init    → install skills/rules/hooks/MCP config → start daemon (last step)
archnaut start   → fork detached child → write PID → poll GET /health (200ms, 5s timeout)
archnaut stop    → read PID → SIGTERM → remove PID file
archnaut status  → process.kill(pid, 0) + GET /health probe
```

Bootstrap sequence (no archnaut.json yet):
1. init starts daemon; DB starts empty
2. developer triggers scan skill in AI tool
3. agent calls cleararchitecture → addnode/addedge → server writes first archnaut.json
